.Dd September 6, 2025
.Dt DCHAT 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm dchat
.Nd door-based chat utility
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Cm read
.
.Nm
.Cm write
.
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Nm
utility provides a simple chat interface using illumos doors for inter-process
communication. It operates in two modes: as a door client that receives and
displays messages
.Pq Cm read ,
or as a door client that sends messages
.Pq Cm write .
You will need to use
.Xr tmux 1
or
.Xr screen 1
to open these utilities up in separate panes, because bothering with a proper
interface would make the code a lot more complicated, and we only care about
this as a tutorial for doors.
.Pp
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr door_call 3C ,
.Xr door_create 3C ,
.Xr door_return 3C ,
.Xr door_ucred 3C ,
.Xr fattach 2 ,
.Xr fdetach 2
